  "user_requirements": "The text may describe one incident or several. Return a list called incidents with one entry for each incident. Each entry has these fields, all optional (leave out what the text does not mention):\n- Date (Incident date)\n- Time (Incident time)\n- Location (Where the incident happened)\n- Description (Brief description of what happened)\n- People involved (Names, with roles if mentioned)\n- Injuries (Injuries reported, if any)\n- Damages (Property or equipment damage, if any)\n- Immediate actions (Immediate actions taken)\n- Witnesses (Witness names, if any)\n- Severity (Severity: low, medium, high or critical, judged from the report)\n- Incident type (Type, such as slip or fall, near miss, equipment failure, vehicle, fire or spill)\n- Root cause (The likely cause of the incident)\n- Corrective actions (Corrective or preventive actions, stated or recommended)\n- Reported by (Who wrote or reported the incident)\n- Equipment involved (Machines, vehicles or tools involved)"
